      "detailed_description": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288080/extras/0642fc7fce18223a0dac0ad776503159.webp?t=1770343580\" width=616 height=55 /></span><br>Maumau, an adventurer, found a huge treasure chest in an ancient ruin.<br>However, she was taken into the other dimension by the girl who appeared from the treasure chest.<br>Maumau's unique adventure to survive begins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288080/extras/988a4aff11e4d06fc8091ce64493e363.webp?t=1770343580\" width=616 height=55 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Card combat.</li></ul>It's turn-based. Players can use cards to fight.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Skill enhancement system.</li></ul>Skill Points are earned through battle and can be used to unlock new skills and enhance their effects.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3D Dungeon.</li></ul>This is a 3D dungeon RPG with various treasures sleeping in it and strong enemies lurking.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Quest system.</li></ul>The game contains main quests and side quests. Complete these quests will promote the story.",
